1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,740
Barf ki raat.

2
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:03,640
Pahad soya hua...

3
00:00:04,070 --> 00:00:06,466
lekin kuch jaag raha hai.

4
00:00:06,506 --> 00:00:08,046
Saat din ka safar.

5
00:00:08,196 --> 00:00:09,146
Bina aag,

6
00:00:09,186 --> 00:00:10,406
bina awaaz.

7
00:00:10,526 --> 00:00:12,016
Sirf ek talwar...

8
00:00:12,186 --> 00:00:13,300
aur ek vaada.

9
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:14,560
Phir usne dekha...

10
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:15,880
barf mein kadam.

11
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:17,262
Uske nahi the.

12
00:00:17,302 --> 00:00:18,262
Ek aurat.

13
00:00:18,582 --> 00:00:19,762
Safed kapde...

14
00:00:20,062 --> 00:00:21,482
aur aankhon mein barf

15
00:00:21,522 --> 00:00:22,847
se bhi zyada thand.

16
00:00:22,887 --> 00:00:24,577
Wo yuki onna thi.

17
00:00:24,757 --> 00:00:26,927
Jo har toofan ke saath aati hai...

18
00:00:27,157 --> 00:00:29,942
aur jise dekhne wale wapas nahi jaate.

19
00:00:29,982 --> 00:00:32,152
Gufa ke saamne dono ruke.

20
00:00:32,372 --> 00:00:33,832
Usne talwar nikaali...

21
00:00:33,922 --> 00:00:35,775
aur barf ban gayi aag.

22
00:00:35,815 --> 00:00:36,645
Ek vaar.

23
00:00:36,975 --> 00:00:37,595
Barf,

24
00:00:37,995 --> 00:00:38,665
hawa...

25
00:00:39,035 --> 00:00:40,565
aur poori khamoshi.

26
00:00:40,605 --> 00:00:42,585
Subah tak sab safed tha.

27
00:00:42,885 --> 00:00:44,025
Sirf uske kadam...

28
00:00:44,195 --> 00:00:45,068
jaate hue.

29
00:00:45,108 --> 00:00:46,128
Kya wo bachi?

30
00:00:46,338 --> 00:00:47,608
Kisi ne nahi dekha.

31
00:00:47,828 --> 00:00:48,988
Part 2 chahiye?

32
00:00:49,048 --> 00:00:49,908
Comment karo...

33
00:00:49,988 --> 00:00:50,617
BARF.
